OL,3,ATennessee governor declines to halt
OL,4,Aexecution of state's lone woman on
OL,5,Adeath row
OL,6,
OL,7,FTennessee Governor Bill Lee has denied
OL,8,Fa clemency request from death row
OL,9,Finmate Christa Pike, who is scheduled
OL,10,Fto be executed by lethal injection on
OL,11,FWednesday.
OL,13,FPike, now 50, was 18 when she and her
OL,14,Fthen-boyfriend beat, tortured and
OL,15,Fmurdered Colleen Slemmer, a 19-year-old
OL,16,Fthey met at a job training camp for
OL,17,Ftroubled teens.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
