OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATennessee governor declines to halt
OL,4,Aexecution of state's lone woman on
OL,5,Adeath row
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe may have one last chance at halting
OL,8,Fher execution as her attorneys have
OL,9,Ffiled a petition with the US Supreme
OL,10,FCourt hoping for a last-minute
OL,11,Freprieve.
OL,13,FIf it proceeds, Pike would be the first
OL,14,Fwoman to be executed in Tennessee in
OL,15,Fmore than 200 years. Only 18 women have
OL,16,Fbeen executed in the US since the
OL,17,F1970s, compared to 1,663 men.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
